      "value": "<p>&gt;@UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.class-features.bSx9gMPZnyCUHyhG]{Rover}</p>\n<p>You easily move around both treacherous terrain and dangerous creatures without either slowing you down. You ignore all non-magical difficult terrain. Further, you don’t provoke attacks of opportunity from moving through an enemy’s threatened space, though you still provoke attacks of opportunity as normal when casting a spell or making a ranged attack.</p>"
